{"page":312,"verses":[{"verse_key":"19:96","surah":19,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ سَيَجْعَلُ لَهُمُ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ وُدًّا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But the Lord of Mercy will give love to those who believe and do righteous deeds:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and did","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"good deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَيَجْعَلُ","en_gloss":"will bestow","transliteration":"sayajʿalu","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmānu","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وُدًّۭا","en_gloss":"affection","transliteration":"wuddan","verse_key":"19:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٩٦","en_gloss":"(96)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:96"}]},{"verse_key":"19:97","surah":19,"ayah":97,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِنَّمَا يَسَّرْنَـٰهُ بِلِسَانِكَ لِتُبَشِّرَ بِهِ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ وَتُنذِرَ بِهِۦ قَوْمًا لُّدًّا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have made it easy, in your own language [Prophet], so that you may bring glad news to the righteous and warnings to a stubborn people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"So, only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"19:97"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسَّرْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We (have) made it easy","transliteration":"yassarnāhu","verse_key":"19:97"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِلِسَانِكَ","en_gloss":"in your tongue","transliteration":"bilisānika","verse_key":"19:97"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِتُبَشِّرَ","en_gloss":"that you may give glad tidings